msgctxt "80"
msgid "Urgh..."
msgstr "Urgh..."

msgctxt "92"
msgid "Hiroto!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "104"
msgid ""
"So Rikiya was right all along. You really are Natsumi. Haven't you stopped "
"to think about how he feels in all this?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "116"
msgid ""
"What's it to you? He said he'd do whatever I wanted, so I'm taking him up on"
" the offer! Besides, it's none of your business!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "128"
msgid ""
"Enough excuses. Come with me. It's time you see just how far Rikiya's "
"willing to go for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "152"
msgid "It's nothing like that! I told you, he's just my bodyguard!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid ""
"Come on, girl. You, me, and every other bitch on the street knows you're "
"using him!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid "(Hold on... Isn't that Akiho?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"But seriously, Natsumi. I'm like, sooo jealous. How'd you get a brute like "
"that doing your dirty work for you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Isn't it just the greatest? I was kinda shocked when he told me he was from "
"Okinawa, but it turns out he's this guy Rikiya I used to sit next to in "
"middle school."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid ""
"He started going on and on and on with these old stories from when we were "
"kids. Total snoozefest."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"But oh, get this! It turns out he's part of the Okinawa yakuza! And not only"
" that, but he's dumb as a rock! He'll believe any old sob story I tell him."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid "(What!?)"
msgstr "(Cosa!?)"

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Haha, yeah. What was that fake name you gave him again? Akiho or something? "
"Where'd you even come up with that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"Besides, wouldn't most guys know if their \"best friend\" has a sister? "
"Like, get a clue, dude!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid ""
"Are you really surprised? All those yakuza thugs are all brawns and no "
"brains. Natsumi needs a man like me who's got the whole package. Ain't that "
"right, baby?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Yeah, yeah, your \"whole package\" is the only thing you ever talk about! "
"But I'll admit, I never would've come up with that plan on my own. It's "
"thanks to you I'm gonna be living debt-free!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"That's what happens when you hang with a man of ideas, sweetheart. It was a "
"real stroke of genius, conning that yakuza fool into paying off your loan. "
"What would you do without me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"My bank account would have a few less zeros in it, that's for sure! Anyway, "
"I'm finally done owing your club for all the drinks I bought! Which means I "
"can start spending money on you again!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "Mm, and that's why I love you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "What's going on here?"
msgstr "Che succede qui?"

msgctxt "344"
msgid "Oh, um!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "356"
msgid "Akiho... or should I say Natsumi?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "Whichever it is, you've got some explaining to do. Come with me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"She's not going anywhere, you old fuck! What gives you the right to just "
"walk up and snag some other guy's girl?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"All I want to do is talk to her. But if you're looking for a fight, I'd be "
"glad to oblige."
msgstr ""

